后台修改人数上限：上限变了才落盘并广播新的房间信息。上限调到比当前人数还低时不踢人，已经在房间里的成员还能再开连接，新的成员要等人数降到新的上限以下才进得来。调高上限之后，新的成员立即进得来。
-- 01 --
> restore persistent
-- 02 --
> 0s join s1 m1
emit 1.1 members [s1=m1]
reply q02 done
-- 03 --
> 0s join s2 m2
emit 1.2 members [s1=m1 s2=m2]
reply q03 done
-- 04 --
> 0s join s3 m3
emit 1.3 members [s1=m1 s2=m2 s3=m3]
reply q04 done
-- 05 --
> 1s capacity 2
persist mode=sequential entrySeq=0 current=- pending=- waiting=[]
emit 1.4 info 房间 |  capacity=2
reply q05 done
-- 06 --
> 2s join s4 m4
reply q06 error room-full 房间已满，最多 2 人。
-- 07 --
> 2s join s5 m1
emit 1.5 members [s1=m1 s2=m2 s3=m3 s5=m1]
reply q07 done
-- 08 --
> 3s leave s3
emit 1.6 members [s1=m1 s2=m2 s5=m1]
-- 09 --
> 3s join s4 m4
reply q09 error room-full 房间已满，最多 2 人。
-- 10 --
> 4s leave s2
emit 1.7 members [s1=m1 s5=m1]
-- 11 --
> 4s join s4 m4
emit 1.8 members [s1=m1 s5=m1 s4=m4]
reply q11 done
-- 12 --
> 5s capacity 2
reply q12 done
-- 13 --
> 6s capacity 3
persist mode=sequential entrySeq=0 current=- pending=- waiting=[]
emit 1.9 info 房间 |  capacity=3
reply q13 done
-- 14 --
> 6s join s6 m2
emit 1.10 members [s1=m1 s5=m1 s4=m4 s6=m2]
reply q14 done
-- 15 --
> 6s join s7 m3
reply q15 error room-full 房间已满，最多 3 人。
